# Modelica: Modelica Language Specification 3.6, chapter 2 Lexical Structure; requirements/languages/modelica.md
name     modelica mo
keyword  model class record block connector type package function operator end extends within import
keyword  equation algorithm initial parameter constant input output flow stream discrete if then else
keyword  elseif for loop in while when elsewhen der connect public protected partial final inner
keyword  outer replaceable redeclare annotation each and or not
type     Real Integer Boolean String
builtin  true false time pi
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes multiline
operators  +-*/^=<>:.
calls
upper-type
